# Every Python service with the extras CI tests and the Docker images install.
# decision-maker[nlp] (PyTorch) is opt-in and deliberately not locked here.
# Regenerate requirements/python.lock with scripts/lock-python.sh after editing
# any pyproject.toml dependency.
./microservices/agentic-search[dev]
./microservices/decision-maker[pg,agent,dev]
./microservices/jev-tool[dev]
./microservices/research-api[dev]
./microservices/scraper-analysis[dev]
./microservices/volatility-surface-builder[live,dev]
./microservices/yahoo-finance-mcp[dev]
